---
permalink: "/areas/index.html"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="content">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Where to Stay in Zanzibar — Areas & Beaches Guide</h1>
    <p class="page-meta">Each zone has a distinct character. Choose by your travel style: nightlife & diving (Nungwi/Kendwa), kitesurfing & adventure (Paje), culture & history (Stone Town), luxury & relaxation (Bwejuu/Michamvi), or authentic village life (Jambiani/Kizimkazi).</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section section-gradient">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Quick Picks</span>
        <h2>Quick Picks by Travel Style</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Match your vibe to the perfect zone — from party beaches to secluded hideaways.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="area-quick-picks">
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 8C28.6863 8 26 10.6863 26 14V24H18V14C18 8.9706 21.9706 5 26 5C30.0294 5 34 8.9706 34 14V24H38V14C38 10.6863 35.3137 8 32 8ZM26 26V38H38V26H26ZM18 38H46V42H18V38Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M32 18C32 23.5228 27.5228 28 22 28C16.4772 28 12 23.5228 12 18C12 12.4772 16.4772 8 22 8C27.5228 8 32 12.4772 32 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/nungwi/">Best Nightlife & Sunsets</a></h3>
            <p><strong>Nungwi & Kendwa</strong> — Full-moon parties, beach bars, sunset cruises, Mnemba diving</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M12 42C12 37.5817 15.5817 34 20 34H44C48.4183 34 52 37.5817 52 42V46H12V42Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/paje/">Best for Kitesurfing & Adventure</a></h3>
            <p><strong>Paje & Jambiani</strong> — World-class kitesurfing, shallow lagoon, Kuza Cave, Jozani Forest access</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 8C28.6863 8 26 10.6863 26 14V24H18V14C18 8.9706 21.9706 5 26 5C30.0294 5 34 8.9706 34 14V24H38V14C38 10.6863 35.3137 8 32 8ZM26 26V38H38V26H26ZM18 38H46V42H18V38Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/stone-town/">Best for Culture & History</a></h3>
            <p><strong>Stone Town</strong> — UNESCO heritage, carved doors, spice markets, Freddie Mercury, slave trade history</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M16 22L32 8L48 22V54H16V22Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M16 34H48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/bwejuu/">Best Luxury & Seclusion</a></h3>
            <p><strong>Bwejuu, Dongwe, Michamvi, Pongwe</strong> — Boutique resorts, private beaches, The Rock Restaurant</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 10C28.134 10 25 13.134 25 17C25 20.866 28.134 24 32 24C35.866 24 39 20.866 39 17C39 13.134 35.866 10 32 10Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M32 24V44" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/kizimkazi/">Best for Dolphin Watching & Village Life</a></h3>
            <p><strong>Kizimkazi</strong> — Ethical dolphin tours, 12th-century mosque, Menai Bay access, quiet beaches</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">All Zones</span>
        <h2>Explore All Areas</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">14 distinct zones across Unguja and Pemba — each with its own character, hotels, and attractions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid area-grid">
        {% for zone in zones %}
          <article class="card area-card reveal">
            <div class="card-image image-placeholder">
              {% if zone.island == 'Pemba' %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 8L14 30V50H50V30L32 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              {% elif zone.name in ['Stone Town', 'Kizimkazi'] %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 8C28.6863 8 26 10.6863 26 14V24H18V14C18 8.9706 21.9706 5 26 5C30.0294 5 34 8.9706 34 14V24H38V14C38 10.6863 35.3137 8 32 8ZM26 26V38H38V26H26ZM18 38H46V42H18V38Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              {% elif zone.name in ['Nungwi', 'Kendwa'] %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M12 42C12 37.5817 15.5817 34 20 34H44C48.4183 34 52 37.5817 52 42V46H12V42Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              {% elif zone.name in ['Paje', 'Jambiani'] %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 10C28.134 10 25 13.134 25 17C25 20.866 28.134 24 32 24C35.866 24 39 20.866 39 17C39 13.134 35.866 10 32 10Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M32 24V44" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              {% else %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/></svg>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <h3 class="card-title"><a href="/areas/{{ zone.slug }}/">{{ zone.name }}</a></h3>
              <p class="card-meta">{{ zone.island }}</p>
              <p class="card-description">{{ zone.description }}</p>
              <div class="area-tags">
                {% for tour_slug in zone.tours %}
                  {% set tour_obj = tours | selectattr("seo_slug", "equalto", tour_slug) | first %}
                  {% if tour_obj %}<span class="card-badge badge-{{ tour_obj.category | lower }}">{{ tour_obj.category }}</span>{% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
              <p class="card-meta" style="margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.8rem;">{{ zone.hotel_count }} hotels · {{ zone.attraction_count }} attractions · {{ zone.tours | length }} recommended tours</p>
              <div class="card-footer" style="justify-content: flex-start; border-top: none; padding-top: 0;">
                <a href="/areas/{{ zone.slug }}/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Explore {{ zone.name }} →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">By Island</span>
        <h2>By Island</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Two islands, countless experiences.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="area-quick-picks">
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 8C28.6863 8 26 10.6863 26 14V24H18V14C18 8.9706 21.9706 5 26 5C30.0294 5 34 8.9706 34 14V24H38V14C38 10.6863 35.3137 8 32 8ZM26 26V38H38V26H26ZM18 38H46V42H18V38Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Unguja (Main Island — Zanzibar)</h3>
            <p>{{ areas.stats.unguja_hotels }} partner hotels across {{ areas.stats.unguja_zones }} zones</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; color: var(--dct-text-muted);">Stone Town, Nungwi, Kendwa, Paje, Jambiani, Kiwengwa, Pongwe, Bwejuu, Michamvi, Kizimkazi, Fumba, Matemwe</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="64" height="64" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M32 8L14 30V50H50V30L32 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Pemba Island</h3>
            <p>{{ areas.stats.pemba_hotels }} partner hotels across {{ areas.stats.pemba_zones }} zones</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; color: var(--dct-text-muted);">Wambaa Gulf, Makangale, Chake Chake, North Pemba — world-class diving, clove plantations, Fundu Lagoon</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}